Each layer is usable with only the layers below it, and a lower layer never names an upper one: 0 the AI-Activity templates, 1 their executables, 2 VS Code, 3 Emacs and VS Code, 4 Emacs and VS Code Claude, 5 the same plus AI-Activity. Python in bisos.vscodeClaude, elisp in this package; the dashed arrows are what an upper layer supplies to a lower one.
